      "questionText": "<p><strong>Drag and drop to complete the sentences.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/16517-2_eefc4e2e.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p>1. The Alps <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.1</label><input id='fbo-909117-0' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='0' name='fbo-909117-0' type='text' size='18' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909117-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;in Europe is famous for its picturesque scenery and as a top skiing destination.</p>\n<p>2. Colorful <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.2</label><input id='fbo-909117-1' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='1' name='fbo-909117-1' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909117-1' /></span></strong> formations in the Maldives attract divers and snorkelers from all over the world.</p>\n<p>3. Australia&#8217;s Daintree rainforest is a UNESCO World Heritage site, recognized for its flora and <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.3</label><input id='fbo-909117-2' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='2' name='fbo-909117-2' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909117-2' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p>4. Borneo&#8217;s <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.4</label><input id='fbo-909117-3' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='3' name='fbo-909117-3' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909117-3' /></span></strong> is known for its rich ecosystems, including rare species like the orangutan and pygmy elephant.</p>",
