      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the sentences, using the words given. You can only use the words once.</strong><strong> You may need to change the form of the words.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 91.1078%; height: 46px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 46px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\"><strong>peak</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\"><strong>national park</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\"><strong>paradise</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.9196%; height: 46px; text-align: center;\"><strong>biodiversity</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br>1. In the United States, <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.1</label><input id='fbo-909644-0' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='0' name='fbo-909644-0' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909644-0' /></span></strong>&nbsp;like Yosemite and Grand Canyon offer breathtaking views of natural wonders.</p>\n<p>2. The Great Barrier Reef is a UNESCO World Heritage site because of its rich marine <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.2</label><input id='fbo-909644-1' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='1' name='fbo-909644-1' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909644-1' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p>3. The <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.3</label><input id='fbo-909644-2' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='2' name='fbo-909644-2' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909644-2' /></span></strong>&nbsp;of Machu Picchu offers an amazing view of the ancient Inca city and the surrounding mountains.</p>\n<p>4. The Gal&#225;pagos Islands are a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>2.4</label><input id='fbo-909644-3' class='ms fillblank-option-2' index='3' name='fbo-909644-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909644-3' /></span></strong> for wildlife lovers, with species found nowhere else on Earth.</p>",
