      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"116\">Anna: Have you ever visited any natural wonders of the world?</p>\n<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"277\">John: Yes, I&#8217;ve been to the Great Barrier Reef in Australia. It felt like a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-909617-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-909617-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909617-0'></option><option value=\"theme\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-0-theme'>theme</option><option value=\"paradise\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-0-paradise'>paradise</option></select></span></strong> underwater, with colorful coral&nbsp;reefs and diverse marine life.</p>\n<p data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"404\">Anna: That sounds amazing! I&#8217;ve always wanted to explore the Amazon <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-909617-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-909617-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909617-1'></option><option value=\"complex\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-1-complex'>complex</option><option value=\"rainforest\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-1-rainforest'>rainforest</option></select></span></strong>. The biodiversity there is incredible.</p>\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"592\">John: Absolutely! It is like a living treasure chest, full of plants and animals. Have you heard about the Grand Canyon? The <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-909617-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-909617-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909617-2'></option><option value=\"valley\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-2-valley'>valley</option><option value=\"metro\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-2-metro'>metro</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;there is so vast and breathtaking.</p>\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"705\">Anna: I&#8217;ve read about it! I&#8217;d love to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-909617-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-909617-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-909617-3'></option><option value=\"experiment\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-3-experiment'>experiment</option><option value=\"explore\" data-testid='fillblank-option-909617-3-explore'>explore</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;it one day. The landscapes seem so unique and majestic.</p>\n<p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"783\">John: You should definitely visit it! It&#8217;s a once-in-a-lifetime experience.</p>",
